Recipients receive their Covered Software rights from the Licensor under these terms. You cannot authorize Commercial Use on behalf of the Licensor. Your genuinely independent, separable material may have its own terms; no such terms may remove the restrictions on Covered Software. Third-party terms remain separate, and this section does not purport to impose new restrictions on those owners' material.

